WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.720
Everybody's gone!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.400
Look, honey, this summer is gonna be great.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.740
You're going to make friends.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.880
There's nothing to worry about.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.080
Welcome to the Rim of the World Adventure Camp.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.900
Alex. I am your leader, Logan.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.560
I love you.
Mom!

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.560
Hey, Zhenzhen!
Where are you going?

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:29.980
I don't think we should wander this far.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.756
Maybe we should head back?

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:32.640
Follow me.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.500
What was that?

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.878
Never seen anything like them.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.000
It's Independence Day.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.540
It's June, Gabriel!

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.260
You need to wait here 
until the adults realize they left us.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.580
Go! Run!

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.500
Did you see the size of that thing?

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.300
Stop talking.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.140
Please stop.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.620
Was that an alien?

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.400
Let's go!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.460
It has the dog!

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:12.160
We need to find our parents.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.600
We got to get to the city.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.240
Do not move!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.280
We're at war.
You're not safe here.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.100
You'd better go.
We can't leave you!

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.140
Take this key.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.200
It's on you now.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:29.940
This is a crypto-key.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.720
It can activate our satellite defense.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.560
We should try to find JPL.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.180
It's a NASA facility 70 miles away from here.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.520
How are we supposed to go 70 miles?

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.920
1973 Ford Mustang Mach 1.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.560
I can't drive a stick.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:52.580
Yeah, Zhenzhen!
Hold on tight!

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.280
This is Animal Kingdom here.

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.820
Hang on!
We have each other,

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.180
and we can't give up now.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.060
I'm your master now.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.980
No, the line is,

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.700
"Now I am the master."

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.400
Okay, we really need to get you a girl.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:25.600
May I propose a toast?

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:28.080
Crap! This is from 1969.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:31.280
At least get fresh wine 
if this is gonna be my first time, right?

